# Private test site: never indexed (roadmap M1.2, security plan #21).
# Remove or change the robots line before the live site at M10 — public shared set pages must be
# indexable (spec 8.4). The other four stay: the app's own screens are never framed by anyone
# (clickjacking), a file is what its type says, and the address of a screen is not handed to the
# sites a person taps through to (the app-code review, 2026-10-12). The share pages the Worker
# serves carry their own, fuller policy (worker/index.ts, pageHeaders).
/*
  X-Robots-Tag: noindex, nofollow
  X-Frame-Options: DENY
  Content-Security-Policy: frame-ancestors 'none'
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
